:agent="v1" begin="00:20.190" end="00:22.800"><span begin="00:20.190" end="00:20.430">But </span><span begin="00:20.430" end="00:20.490">i </span><span begin="00:20.490" end="00:20.760">couldn't </span><span begin="00:20.760" end="00:21.090">stay </span><span begin="00:21.090" end="00:21.840">faithful </span><span begin="00:21.840" end="00:22.110">if </span><span begin="00:22.110" end="00:22.200">i've </span><span begin="00:22.200" end="00:22.800">tried</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.800" end="00:25.680"><span begin="00:22.800" end="00:22.890">I </span><span begin="00:22.890" end="00:23.190">turned </span><span begin="00:23.190" end="00:23.310">in </span><span begin="00:23.310" end="00:23.520">to </span><span begin="00:23.520" end="00:23.610">a </span><span begin="00:23.610" end="00:24.030">devil </span><span begin="00:24.030" end="00:24.150">you </span><span begin="00:24.150" end="00:24.300">could </span><span begin="00:24.300" end="00:24.540">see </span><span begin="00:24.540" end="00:24.750">it </span><span begin="00:24.750" end="00:24.870">in </span><span begin="00:24.870" end="00:25.050">my </span><span begin="00:25.050" end="00:25.680">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.860" end="00:28.560"><span begin="00:25.860" end="00:26.010">I </span><span begin="00:26.010" end="00:26.520">blacked </span><span begin="00:26.520" end="00:26.760">out </span><span begin="00:26.760" end="00:27.000">told </span><span begin="00:27.000" end="00:27.210">you </span><span begin="00:27.210" end="00:27.720">everything </span><span begin="00:27.720" end="00:27.840">i </span><span begin="00:27.840" end="00:28.140">ever </span><span begin="00:28.140" end="00:28.560">did</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.740" end="00:31.320"><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:28.830">I </span><span begin="00:28.830" end="00:29.220">couldn't </span><span begin="00:29.220" end="00:29.640">take </span><span begin="00:29.640" end="00:29.760">all </span><span begin="00:29.760" end="00: